  "description": "The ODIN 5 sports a cutting-edge frame design that elevates both its aesthetics and performance, making it a standout on rugged trails. This new geometry not only enhances maneuverability and stability but also ensures a more dynamic and responsive ride.The Enhanced ODIN V FrameHit the trails and let the good times roll with the Vamoose ODIN V mountain bike! Engineered to conquer bumps and turn chattery trails into smooth rides, the ODIN V features front and rear shocks that soak up the rough stuff so you don't have to. It's all about less impact and more traction, delivering a ride that's not just forgiv,ng it's downright indulgent. Plus, with hydraulic disc brakes that bring you to a stop with barely a whisper of a finger, the ODIN V lets you handle the gnarliest trails with swagger.This cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 48V 500W Rear Hub Motor\n\n• 48V 15A Samsung Battery\n\n• UK River UKS2 Color Display\n\n• 1:1 intelligent pedal assist system (PAS)\n\n• Front and rear LED lights\n\n• KENDA™ Krusade tires\n\nSPECIFICATIONSSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nSingle Rear\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\nN/A\n\nRear Motor:\nBAFANG 48V 500W\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO ACERA 7-SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nThrottle w shut off\n\nDisplay:\nUK River UKS2 WITH USB\n\nBattery:\n48V 15 Ah SAMSUNG\n\nCharger:\n3A\n\nFront forks :\nBOXER 120 mm travel air fork\n\nRear Suspension:\nA55 Air Shock\n\nFrame:\n6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nTektro Hydraulic E350\n\nWheels:\n26\" x 4.0\" KENDA\n\nPedals:\nJinyea K303\n\nSaddle:\nVelo Black\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nRear rack\n\nFenders:\nPlastic\n\nFront and rear lights:\nLED Wired\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque (per motor):\n80 Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n768\n\nMiles per charge:\n38\n\nKms per charge:\n68\n\nBattery charge time:\n4-6 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYES\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n160 x 30 x 82\n\nBox dimensions (inch):\n63 x 12 x 32\n\nWeights (metric):\n36kg NW 